COMMENT  this macro functions the same as HELP/V except that
COMMENT  it uses BROWSE to look at HELP files
COMMENT  and HELP switches are ignored

push;prompt pop

[!nequal cli32 [!cli]]
write ERROR:,,HELPB requires CLI32
[!else]

[!equal () (%1%)]
help
[!end]

var/name=loop     0

[!loopstart [!argument/macro/count]]

var/name=loop     [!uadd,1,[!var/name=loop]]
string/name=arg   [!arg/macro/item=[!var/name=loop]]

string/name=name  [!string/name=arg]
string/name=key   CMD

[!equal,*,[!substring/item=1 [!string/name=arg]]]
string/name=name  [!substring/item=2- [!string/name=arg]]
string/name=key   TPC
[!end]

[!equal,!,[!substring/item=1 [!string/name=arg]]]
string/name=name  [!substring/item=2- [!string/name=arg]]
string/name=key   PSM
[!end]

string/name=file/k

COMMENT  look for an exact match using the name as an abbreviation;
COMMENT  any CLI32 help file will have precedence over any CLI help file

var/name=CLI32 [!filenames/count  [!pathname :help]:cli32.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]-]
var/name=CLI   [!filenames/count  [!pathname :help]:cli.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]-]

[!equal,1,[!var/name=CLI32]]
string/name=file [!f [!pathname :help]:cli32.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]-]
[!end]

[!equal,0,[!var/name=CLI32]]
   [!equal,1,[!var/name=CLI]]
   string/name=file [!f [!pathname :help]:cli.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]-]
   [!end]
[!end]


COMMENT  look for an exact match using just the name

var/name=CLI32 [!filenames/count  [!pathname :help]:cli32.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]]
var/name=CLI   [!filenames/count  [!pathname :help]:cli.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]]

[!equal,1,[!var/name=CLI32]]
string/name=file [!f [!pathname :help]:cli32.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]]
[!end]

[!equal,0,[!var/name=CLI32]]
   [!equal,1,[!var/name=CLI]]
   string/name=file [!f [!pathname :help]:cli.[!string/name=key].[!string/name=name]]
   [!end]
[!end]


[!nequal () ([!string/name=file])]
x :util:browse/f/mode=2 [!string/name=file]
[!else]
help [!string/name=arg]
[!end]


[!loopend]

[!end]
pop
